  "applies_to": "ICP DAS M-7080 and M-7080B two-channel 32-bit counter/frequency modules with two digital outputs, in Modbus RTU mode.",
  "summary": "The M-7080 and M-7080B are RS-485 remote I/O modules that count pulses or measure frequency on two inputs and drive two digital outputs. In Modbus RTU mode the 32-bit counts sit in holding registers as low/high word pairs, and configuration flags are coils. This map covers the count/frequency values, maximum and preset values, input thresholds, outputs and counter control.",
